  << /ActualText (\240Interview Questions for Spark Research Participants\nWhen you feel mentally cluttered or overwhelmed\054 what do you usually do to make sense of things\077\nCan you walk me through the last time you captured a thought\054 idea\054 or insight\077 Where did it go\077\nHow often do you revisit your notes\054 journal entries\054 or saved ideas \024 and what usually happens when you do\077\nHave you ever noticed patterns in your thinking or behaviour\077 How did you recognise them\077\035\nTell me about a moment when you felt stuck but knew you needed clarity\056 What did you try\077\035\nWhat helps you trust your own judgement when making a decision or taking a step forward\077\035\nWhat would a small\054 meaningful step look like for you right now \024 something that feels doable\054 not overwhelming\077\035\nHow do you feel about apps accessing your personal notes or reflections\077 What would make you feel safe or unsafe\077\035\nWhat kind of notification feels supportive to you \024 and what kind feels intrusive or annoying\077\035\n10 \056If an app could surface an insight from your past thoughts at exactly the right moment\054 what would you want that moment to feel like\077\035)
     /K [ 183 ]
