5320 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Research goals\072 \nTest the key assumptions at the core of the product \055 i\056e\056 the barrier to acting is pattern blindness\054 fragmented knowledge\054 courage gap\077 \nUnderstand what people\031s personal barriers\057blockers are to taking action and igniting their creativity\nUnderstand what tech users are currently using to support their self\055reflection and action\nUnderstand attitudes towards data sharing \n\nIntro to create a safe space\072 \nI\031m not looking for perfect answer\054 just honest experiences\056 Feel free to take your time\056 There\031s no expectation to have things figured out\056 I\031m much more interested in the messy\054 real parts\056 if something doesn\031t resonate\054 we can move on\056 I really appreciate you being open with me\056\n\nWarm up questions  \050we don\031t need all of these\051 \nWhat does a typical day look like for you at the moment\077 \nWhat is currently taking up most of your mental space\077 \nHow do you usually make sense of your thoughts\077 \050write them down\054 talk them out\054 journal\054 listen to podcasts etc\051\056\nprobe on tech used\n\nActing on ideas\057barriers to ideas\nWhen you have an idea or something you want to do\054 what usually happens next\077 \nCan you tell me about the last time you had an idea or intention that felt important\054 but you didn\031t quite turn it into action\077 \nWhat do you think got in the way\077 \050testing assumption that it\031s not seeing the patterns in their thinking\051 \n\nFinding meaning \046 connection\nCan you tell me about a time when something just really clicked for you emotionally\054 creatively\054 or mentally\077 \nWhat was going on around you in that moment\077 \nWhat do you think led up to that moment\077 \nhow did that moment feel for you\077 \nWhat did it change for you\077 \nHave you ever felt really connected to yourself\077 What was that like\077\nWhat would help you experience more of that\077\n\nTech\057notifications \nHave you used apps or tools that try to be reflective or mindful\077 What made you stop or keep using these tools\077  \050test the assumption \030drop tools because no reward\054 system building r equires effort\054 no clear payoff\054 insight gaps between sessions\057use\077\051 \nDo you prefer small\054 frequent moments of insight\054 or deeper occasional ones\077\n\nData Trust \nWhat prevents you from using AI\077 what are you afraid of\077 \nWhat kinds of personal information feels most sensitive to you\077\nWhat would make sharing personal information with an app feel worth it to you\077 What would make it not feel worth it\077\n\nHabits\057steps\nCan you tell me about something positive you\031ve stuck with recently\077 What made you want to keep coming back to it\077 \050is this too broad and not focused enough on reward\077\051 \nWhat\031s the difference between something you avoid vs something you don\031t mind returning to\077\n\n\n\n\n\n)
     /K [ 188 ]
     /P 5321 0 R
     /Pg 4945 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

