5322 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The core metaphor Star \046 Constellations \n\nSpark uses a metaphor of \047Stars and Constellations\047 to describe your thoughts\054 notes and reflections\056 Without me explaining it\054 what does that image suggest to you\077\n\n\nDay one Value\n\nThink back to the last time you downloaded or used a new tool for your personnel notes or growth\054 within those first few minutes\054 what was that small discovery or quick win that made decide it was worth keeping\077\n\nPrivacy\n\nHow do you usually decide whether to grant an app permission to access your private data\054 like notes and reflections\077  What makes digital tool feel like a safe \n\nUnderstand current paint points of fragmented knowledge \n\nWhich apps or tools have you tried for notes\054 journaling or feflection \057 for each\054 what was great\077 what made you stop or feel overwhelmed\077 \n\nWalk me through your process of capturing an idea or reflection that resonates with you\056 Where does it go and what happen usually to it a week or so later\077\n\nTell me about a time you felt overwhelmed by the amount of information you\031ve collected \050saved notes\054 articles\054 podcast\056\056books\051 how did you handle that feeling of mental clutter\077\nWhat stops you from connecting the dots between all these saved thoughts and notes\077\n\nCourageous step\n\nWhen you know or almost what you want to do what gets in the way of taking the first step\077\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n)
     /K [ 189 ]
