6255 0 obj
  << /ActualText (a client had knee pain\054 she had to adapt fast and didn\047t have time to dwell on the failure\056 Being in the moment\054 with no space to catastrophise\054 made her productive rather than paralysed\056 With illustration specifically\054 she can see incremental improvement\054 which makes even failed attempts rewarding \024 \042I appreciate where I came from\056\042 Key insight from Nirish\047s closing exchange\072 visible progress acts as its own reward\056 Recognition and appreciation of effort \024 even small \024 is what keeps her going\056)
     /K [ 656 ]
     /P 6256 0 R
     /Pg 4945 0 R
     /S /Span
