6621 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Kate has a  learning\055focused mindset\054 not a natural or intuitive one\056 She has a tendency to over\055assess and over\055analyse everything and that can lead to her working up to the wire\056 She also recognises that she has a strong doing side that appreciates action\054 and often cycles through periods of good focus and then neglect\056 \n\nHer main challenges are habit forming and finding routine boring\056 Her need for novelty distracts her from the consistency that\031s needed for growth\056  She is aware and has some tools\054 but still struggles\056 She fits the profile of the \030awakening achiever\031 well\056 \n\nQuotes\072 \n\030I get that\054 like\054 beginners high\056 And then\054 like a moth to a flame\054 like to go and explore another one\056\031 \n\030I can\031t help myself\054 I\031ll be up the night before a deadline working\031\056\n \nOpportunity for Spark is to find a way to turn Kate\031s love of learning into self\055discovery that is exciting enough and rewarding enough to sustain\056)
     /K [ 839 ]
     /P 6622 0 R
     /Pg 4945 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
