6787 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Summary\nLin has worked hard to get to a place where the systems she uses support a consistent daily reflective practice\054 that helps her to spot patterns in her thinking\056 Structure helps her to feel grounded\056 Financial resilience and taking care of her family is important to her\056\n\nShe has some techniques in place to help her move through periods of being stuck\054 like taking small actions\054 setting daily goals\054 and prioritising\056\n\nShe has discipline and reflection in the short term but lacks confidence in her own narrative \050long term\051\056 Her main challenge is she still struggles to make sense of the bigger picture\054 and trust her conclusions\056 She seeks validation\054 and believes her own memory is unreliable for reconstructing mental models of the past\n\nShe fits the profile of the \030awakened achiever\031 well\056 \034\055 she might be thinking \034Can I trust that what I think is true about myself is actually true\077\035\n\nThe opportunity for Spark is to help provide visible evidence of her own patterns so she starts to trust her interpretation\054 without validation\056 Help her to see the bigger picture of her own life in a way she believes it\056)
     /K [ 922 ]
     /P 6788 0 R
     /Pg 4945 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
