8218 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Junying L \055  Apparel product developer at Nike \n\nWho she is\nJunying is a reputation driven user\054 need social proof\054 brand credibility and a sense of user control over what\031s shared to an app\n\n\nCore problem\nShe can see clearly what she likes \050illustration\054 drawing\051 but kept it as hobby not pursued it professionally\056 She is caught between knowing and doing\056 Lots of intrests\054 nothing finished\056\n\nPattern awareness\ncan articulate her blockers with precision\054 but hasn\047t moved\056 Her awakening is intellectually present but emotionally blocked\056 She\047s stuck in the gap between knowing and doing\054 held there by catastrophised future\055thinking and negative self\055talk\n\n\nNotes and reflection practice and paint point\nShe uses physical journal\054 phone note app\056 Whatsapp boyfriend chat or hers that she organise by topic\056 Kobo for books\056 She just capture just in case but rarely return\056 When she feel overwhelmed by the amount of stored information\054 she ignores it and re\055search on Google or Instagram\056 She finds that faster and requires no excavation\056\n\nThe reasons he reflects\nReflecting bring her back to the present\054 helps her reanalyse priorities for the day or the week\056 \n\nDay one value\nStructure and analysis\056 She wants the app to organise what she gives it and immediately reflect back something meaningful about who she is and her habits\054 values\054 tendencies\056\n\nPrivacy\nOperates on reputational logic\072 known company equals safer bet\056 She\047ll Google an unknown company\054 ask friends\056 Her privacy concern is practical\056 She wouldn\047t store identifiable data in a notes app anyway\054 so the exposure she fears is already self\055limited\056 Her frame is control\072 the app should feel like it\047s operating within a boundary she set\056\n\nHabit formation\nOne high\055quality weekly insight\054 Friday night or Saturday morning\054 during her natural quiet time is something she\047d look forward to\056 She wants to feel that something good is coming at a predictable moment\054 not be interrupted randomly\056 The insight needs to arrive when she\047s already in reflective mode during or just before journaling so it enriches something she\047s already doing rather than demanding a context switch\056\n\nOpportunity and implications for Spark\nJunying doesn\047t know what an app like this would solve for her\054 which means Spark has a clarity problem before it has an engagement problem\056\n\n\n\n\n)
