8234 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Savio \n\nWho he is\nProduct Director based in Berlin\056 Has recently started taking on the role of a though\055leader by publishing her thoughts regularly on LinkedIn and Substack\056 Participated in the 8\055week Unthinking Path group coaching program\056\n\nCore problem\nSavio\031s core challenge is underutilisation of his potential\054 not information overload\056 He captures many ideas but rarely revisits them\054 leaving most of his notes forgotten unless rediscovered by accident\056 He knows he could be leveraging AI and his own thinking more effectively\054 but his current system lacks integration and intentional structure\056 He feels he could make better decisions and take bolder action if he had clearer visibility into his ideas\054 tasks\054 and priorities\056\n\nPattern awareness\nHe is highly aware of his own cognitive and emotional patterns\056 He notices that solutions he creates for one client often apply to others\056 He also recognizes that when he is anxious or irritated\054 his ideas become reactive rather than logical\054 prompting him to step back and revisit them later\056 He consistently captures ideas in his Notes app\054 even in social settings\054 but tries to remain present with others\056 His reflection happens naturally during long walks\054 not through scheduled rituals\056\n\nNotes and reflection practice and paint point\nSavio uses a simple but fragmented system\072 iPhone Notes\054 Google Drive\054 and occasional experiments with Obsidian\056 He has hundreds of notes\054 but only two or three files\024LinkedIn ideas\054 book notes\024are revisited regularly\056 Most notes are forgotten\056 He takes screenshots of books\054 stores them in Notes\054 and uses them for content creation\056 Reflection is constant but unstructured\073 he walks everywhere and uses that time to think\056 His pain point is not capturing ideas\024it\031s retrieving\054 organizing\054 and acting on them\n\nThe reasons he reflects\nReflection helps him\072\nDevelop ideas for writing and content creation\nUnderstand emotional triggers and avoid reactive thinking\nImprove his communication and decision\021making\nExplore solutions for clients\nMaintain clarity as an introvert navigating a new city and new routines\nReflection is woven into his daily life and supports both personal grounding and professional creativity\056\n\nDay one value\nA tool earns his trust if it provides\072\nImmediate clarity\024simple\054 intuitive\054 no friction\nFluidity\024it doesn\031t stop at the task but suggests next steps\nMental fluency\024a sense of flow similar to good human conversation\nSurprise\024new angles\054 new ways of thinking\054 tailored insights\nHe abandons tools instantly if they feel confusing or rigid\056\n\nPrivacy\nSavio sees privacy as a trade\021off\056 He is comfortable giving tools access to his notes and Google Drive if it improves his decision\021making and life\056 He avoids storing highly sensitive information \050e\056g\056\054 passwords\051 but welcomes pattern recognition across his reflections\056 He only feels unsafe when geopolitical narratives or media coverage raise concerns\054 as with the Chinese LLM DeepSeek\056 Transparency\024such as clear statements about data handling\024helps him feel secure\056\n\nHabit formation\nHis habits are shaped by energy management rather than strict routines\056 As an introvert\054 he carefully curates clients and activities to protect his energy\056 He reflects naturally during walks and writes daily for LinkedIn\056 He does not schedule reflection\073 it emerges organically\056 He values tools that support this natural rhythm rather than imposing structure\056\n\nOpportunity for Spark\nSpark can support Savio by becoming a central\054 intelligent hub that\072\nHelps him revisit and connect forgotten notes\nSurfaces patterns across his ideas\054 writing\054 and client work\nProvides visual dashboards that reduce decision anxiety\nSupports his content creation workflow with contextual prompts\nEncourages deeper reflection through question\021based interactions\nOffers clarity and mental fluency from day one\nFeels simple\054 fluid\054 and non\021intrusive\n\n\n\n\n)
