  << /ActualText (DRAFT agenda \0502 hours\051\n\nTimings are flexible\054 and include a 10 min BREAK\n\nWelcome\054 framing and ice breaker  \05010 mins\051\n\nQuick recap of  the user \05015 mins\051 \nRecap insights \050insights \046 persona\051\nJourney mapping \055 review together \n \nDefine focus based on the problem \05020 mins\051\nHMW solve \133the problem\135\nDefine guardrails \050user\054 context\054 desired outcome\054 constraints\051\n\nIdeation \05030 mins\051 \nBad Ideas Party \050Draw 4 bad ideas in 2 mins\041\051\nCrazy 8s  \05010 mins\051 \nShare your ideas \05015 mins\051\n\nStoryboard \0505 mins\051 \nSteal\057go with one idea and create a storyboard \nDot vote on the ideas in the storyboards  \055 criteria of votes \0503 most innovative\054 3 most successful for business\054 3 most feasible to build\051\n\nConsolidate best ideas into one storyboard \05015 mins\051\nDefine entry\054 interaction\054 outcome\n\nWrap up \046 next steps \05010 mins\051)
