8302 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Key insight themes\nMultiple fragmented tools and scattered capture methods\nNotes become passive graveyards\056 Capture happens but retrieval and organisation fails\056 \nFear and lack of self belief are major blockers to action\nPattern recognition journey\057triggers to action \055 the pattern is the action anchor\054 reducing emotional energy\054 overrides the fear\054 and makes them feel safe\056\nUsers need to be nudged from overthinking to motivation\056 Spark needs to bypass users waiting for a good feeling before taking action\056 \050Small \076 big\051\nPeople and accountability trump self\055reflection\054 when it comes to driving action\056 People wait for permission from others to do something\n\nNotifications need to be defined by the user so return visits feel useful and not pushed on them \nPrivacy \055 users need to see a clear benefit of them sharing personal data and are more likely to trust local\054 small and controllable orgs\056 \nDay one value \055 needs to be simple\054 useful\054 immediate insight\054 surprising\054 \nEnergy peaks at the start of an idea or insight\054 but wains when they move into execution and practicalities take over\056)
     /K [ 1682 ]
     /P 8303 0 R
     /Pg 4945 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

