  << /ActualText (Stage 3\072 Passive Reflection \046 Pattern Seeking\n\nThe user attempts to review their history to find direction\054 often feeling \042insight\055poor\042 despite being \042knowledge\055rich\042\056\nGoals\072 Spot subconscious trends\073 identify recurring themes that act as a \042sign\042\056\nPains\072 Manual synthesis is exhausting\073 memory is unreliable for tracing a long\055term professional or personal transformation\056\nNeeds\072 Surfaced insights at the \042right moment\042\073 automatic connection between old and new thoughts\056\nCurrent Workarounds\072 Circling words like \042happiness\042 or \042tired\042 in old journals\073 querying personal Notion archives with AI\056\nQuotes\072\n\042Whenever I don\047t do any sort of morning practice\056\056\056 I feel like I\047m just chasing the rest of the day\056\042 \024 Simon H\n\042I really wish like there\047s like way to process\056\056\056 to tell me what has happened\054 what I have been doing\056\042 \024 Lin Q\n)
