8517 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Stage 4\072 Realization of the \042Courage Gap\042\n\nThe user identifies a meaningful goal \050e\056g\056\054 starting a side business\051 but experiences action paralysis fueled by overthinking and fear\056\nGoals\072 Move from \042learning\042 to \042doing\042\073 overcome the fear of failure\056\nPains\072 Perceived path to success feels \042torturous\042\073 discouragement from self\055talk\073 waiting for \042motivation\042 that never arrives\056\nNeeds\072 A gentle nudge\073 self\055trust\073 a way to \042stay in the present\042 and act on what is in front of them\056\nCurrent Workarounds\072 Creating faux deadlines with friends\073 seeking external validation from mentors\056\nQuotes\072\n\042The fear is that I will not earn enough\056\056\056 mostly my self\055talk that stops me from even doing\054 like\054 step one\056\042 \024 Junying L\n\042Even if they have the answer\054 they\047re not confident enough\056\056\056 and they feel like they need motivation to get started\056\042 \024 Kim W)
