endobj

9447 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Annotation\n\nPurpose of the screen\072 \nDelivers the brand\047s philosophical statement as a felt moment not another marketing tagline\nPositions Spark as a reflective tool\054 not a productivity tool\054 it reflects\054 it does not prescribe\056\nCloses the intro sequence with a clear\054 low\055friction invitation to begin\n \nUI elements\072 \nLarge display quote\054 centred\072 \042I unthink\054 therefore I become\056\042 in Playfair Display italic\nByline\072 \042Unthinking Space\042 in small text\nSupporting line\072 \042Your thinking is already in there\056 Let\047s find it\056\042\nPrimary CTA \050coral\051\072 \042Get started\042  navigates to account creation\nGhost link below\072 \042Or continue as guest\042 navigates directly to mind dump\054 bypassing account setup\nBackground\072 the night sky at its fullest a single complete constellation visible\056 The visual metaphor culminates here\nAudio reaches its quietest point on this screen\nInteractions\nTap \042Get started\042 \222 account creation screen\nTap \042Continue as guest\042 \222 mind dump \050Flow 2\051 directly\nToggle audio on and off\n\nHow the user should feel\072 \nMoved \054 the mantra should land as something true\054 not as a slogan\nReady \054 \042I want to begin now\042\nSafe\054  the guest option means there is no commitment required to explore\n)
     /K [ 2256 ]
     /P 9448 0 R
     /Pg 4945 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

9448 0 obj
  << /K [ 9447 0 R ]
     /P 10187 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 4945 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
