9457 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Annotation \n\nPurpose of the screen\072 \nThis screen lets the user know that their data is there\031s and no one else will be accessing it\nPrivacy language at this step must be warm\054 specific\054 and free of any legal or technical framing so that it builds trust with the user\n\nUI elements\072 \nKey message\072 \034Your data is hosted locally\054 only you will have access to it\056\035\nBackground is a graphic of stars forming the shape of a human\nThere is an audio toggle at the bottom and calming music playing\056 \n\030read more here\031 is a link that takes them to webpage with Sparks privacy policy\n\nInteractions\nThe user can toggle audio on and off\nThe user taps the screen to move on \055\055\076 \nUser can tap the link to read more about the privacy \n\nHow the user should feel\072 \nThe user needs to trust that Spark is hosting their data locally\056)
     /K [ 2261 ]
     /P 9458 0 R
     /Pg 4945 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

