  << /ActualText (Annotation \n\nPurpose of the screen\072 \nTo allow the user to create an account with their name and email\054 or continue as a guest \n \nUI elements\072 \nMain message\072 \030Create your Spark account to start connecting the dots\031\nName\072 text box to type in\056 This is compulsory\nEmail\072 text box for them to type\056\nContinue button is the main CTA \nBackground is an illustration of a starry sky\nThere is an audio toggle at the bottom and calming music playing\056 \n\nInteractions\nThe user can type their name\054 email \nThe user can toggle audio on and off\nThe user can either click continue button or continue as guest \055\055\076\n\nHow the user should feel\072 \nThis should be a quick\054 low effort experience for the user\056 \n)
