9511 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Annotation \n\nPurpose of the screen\072 \nUsers first opportunity to add their notes and content into spark\n \nUI elements\072 \nYellow sun button\057graphic with a \053 in the middle is a button in the centre of the screen \nSmall CTA to \030tap to add notes\031 \nProfile icon is a button at the top right of the screen \nBackground is an illustration of a starry sky\n\nInteractions\nUsers tap the yellow button and it pops up with different options \050see next screen\051\nThe user can skip adding notes and go straight to \030Screen 8\072 Share whats on your mind\0571\031 screen\056\n\nHow the user should feel\072 \nThis should feel easy\054 and not overwhelming\056 They should feel supported to add their notes\056 They should not have to wait for their notes to upload\n)
     /K [ 2289 ]
     /P 9512 0 R
     /Pg 4945 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

