9611 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Annotation\072 \n\nPurpose of the screen\072 \nTo allow users to share anything that\031s on their mind at the moment with Spark\n \nUI elements\072 \nkey question to the user \034Is there a goal you are currently working on\077 Or something your stuck on\077\035\nFree text box where the user can type\056 Single text input\054 no character limit\054 no formatting options \nVoice input option for users in motion\nNo required fields beyond this input\nBackground is an illustration of a starry sky\n\nInteractions\nUsers tap on the microphone to talk into the app\054 and it writes what they have said in the text box \nOR users type directly into the text box \nUser confirms to move to the next screen\n\nHow the user should feel\072 \nthey shouldn\031t feel pressured to share\056 Just encouraged gently to share anything that is on their mind\056 \n\n\n)
     /K [ 2339 ]
     /P 9612 0 R
     /Pg 4945 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
