9645 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Annotation\072 \n\nPurpose of the screen\072 \nto show the user the first constellation that Spark has found based on themes from their notes \n \nUI elements\072 \nA interactive visual of the constellation that spark has found based on all their notes and patterns is the focus of the screen \nA short text summary of the insight below the visual \0501\0552 lines long\051\056 Display a short\054 specific narrative in the user\047s own language\240 not generic insight language\nStars are labelled with key insights\057words\nFollow with a CTA to confirm whether this feels true to them \055 two options \030no \055 regenerate\031 or \030yes\031 \nOption to go to the home page\n\nInteractions\nWhen they click on the star\054 they can see the source data that that insight came from\056  \nSelect \030no\055regenerate\031 and it takes them back to screen 9\056 \nSelect \030yes\031 and it takes them through to the next screen  \n\nHow the user should feel\072 \nInspired and curious about what this constellation means\nThe first thing Spark returns must feel personally surprising\056 Not a category\054 not a summary\054 a specific moment from her own writing returned in a new light\056 This is the product\047s most critical moment and must be treated as such in the design\056\n\n\n)
     /K [ 2356 ]
     /P 9646 0 R
     /Pg 4945 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

