9663 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Annotation\072 \n\n\nPurpose of the screen\072 \nNow the insight has been confirmed\054 Spark generates a courage ladder\054 a visual path of small steps from her current self toward the goal the pattern points to \050her future self\051\056 The ladder is visual\054 with named steps\056 Each rung is a stepping stone\054 not a task\056\nTo give the user the option to take action now\054 when the spark is \n \nUI elements\072 \nKey question to the user \034Ready to take the first small step\077\035 \nA visual of a ladder that has 3 steps on it and leads up to a star\056 as a metaphor for connecting current self to future self \050the star\051\ntwo buttons \055 one to progress to taking some small steps\054 one to take them back to the home page \n\030Go Home\031 button at the bottom \n\nInteractions\n\030Not right now\031 button takes them to the home page \n\030yes \055 I\031m ready\031 takes them to the next page\n\030go home button\031 takes you to the home page  \n\nHow the user should feel\072 \nThe user should feel like they are \n\n\n)
     /K [ 2365 ]
     /P 9664 0 R
     /Pg 4945 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
