9699 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Usability test plan\n\n\nGoals\nClarity \222 Do users understand what Spark is\077\nTrust \222 Are users comfortable sharing personal data\077\nUsability \222 Can users complete key actions without friction\077\nValue \222 Understand if Spark helps them to feel ready to act\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nScenario \nImagine you are taking some time out to do some reflection\056 You\031re thinking about the ideas and conversations you had this week\056 Your friend recommended a new app that helps people spot patterns in their notes\056 You open the app\056 \n\nUsability questions \n\n1\055 Here\031s the Spark landing page\056 Take a moment to look around and tell me what you think Spark is and what it offers\077\nProbe\072 \nHow would you describe this in your own words\077\nWhat stands out to you\077\nWhat do you think this is for\077\nIs anything unclear\077\n\n \n2 \055 Now imagine you\031re signing up or deciding whether to continue as a guest\056 Show me what you\031d do\077 and why\077\nProbe\072 How comfortable do you feel with what\031s being asked here\077\nDoes the tone feel calming or overwhelming\077\nIs anything missing that would help you trust this process\077\n\n3\055 Moving on to the next screen can you add a note\077\056 Walk me through what you\031d do\077\n\nProbe\072How clear are the steps\077\035\n\034Does anything make you hesitate about uploading\077\035\n\034What would make this feel easier or safer\077\n\n4\055 Here\031s a reflection prompt\056 Tell me what you think this screen is asking you to do\056\nProbe\072 Does the question make sense\077\nDoes the screen feel simple or busy\077\n\n5\055 You are at the constellation page tell me what you would do next \nProbe\072Do you know what action to take now\077\nDoes this feel supportive or confusing\077\n\n6\055 Here\031s the Small Steps ladder\056 Show me how you\031d move through and see your next step\077\nProbe\072Does this structure make sense\077\nWould this help you feel ready to take action\077\nDo you understand how to edit steps\077\n\n8\055 After completing a step\054 you see this celebration screen\056 What\031s your reaction\077\nProbe\072Does this feel motivating\077\035\n\034Does it reinforce progress in a meaningful way\077\n\nWhat do you think will happen if you continue\077\n\n\nPrimary Metrics\nCollect these in usability testing\056\n\nFlow Metric\n\nFlow 1 \055 Onboarding\nClarity and comprehension\n80\045 of usability test participants\054 after completing the onboarding flow without assistance\054 can describe what Spark does in their own words \055 and say they would be willing to connect their notes or reflections to the app\056\240\nFlow 2 \055 First Time Use\nIntegration success\n80\045 of usability test participants can successfully connect their notes with Spark\240\nFlow 2 \055 First Time Use\nSurprise and delight\n80\045 of usability test participants can get at least one meaningful spark \050insight\051 from their data in the first time use\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n )
     /K [ 2383 ]
     /P 9700 0 R
     /Pg 4945 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

