  << /ActualText (1\056 I understood what Spark does after completing the onboarding\056\n\050Clarity \046 comprehension \024 positive\051\n\n2\056 I found parts of the onboarding confusing or unclear\056\n\050Clarity \024 negative\051\n\n3\056 I would feel comfortable connecting my notes or reflections to Spark\056\n\050Data\021sharing comfort \024 positive\051\n\n4\056 I felt hesitant or unsure about sharing my personal data with Spark\056\n\050Data\021sharing comfort \024 negative\051\n\n5\056 It was easy for me to connect my notes to Spark during first\021time use\056\n\050Integration success \024 positive\051\n\n6\056 I needed help or felt stuck when trying to connect my notes to Spark\056\n\050Integration success \024 negative\051\n\n7\056 Spark helped me discover at least one meaningful insight from my data\056\n\050Surprise \046 delight \024 positive\051\n\n8\056 The insights Spark provided felt irrelevant or unhelpful\056\n\050Surprise \046 delight \024 negative\051\n\n9\056 I feel Spark would be useful for helping me take small steps or make changes\056\n\050Usefulness \024 positive\051\n\n10\056 I would not want to use Spark regularly as part of my wellbeing routine\056\n\050Overall desirability \024 negative\051)
