  << /ActualText (Accessibility plan\nEnsure Spark is usable\054 understandable\054 and emotionally safe for people with diverse abilities\054 including visual and emotional needs\056\nGoals\072\nEnsure Spark is usable\054 understandable\054 and emotionally safe for people with diverse abilities\054 including visual\054 motor\054 cognitive\054 and emotional needs\056\n\nKey accessibility areas to test\n\nVisual Accessibility\nCan users see and process content clearly\077\n Sufficient colour contrast\nReadable text \n\nCognitive Accessibility\nCan users understand and process what\031s happening\077\n Simple\054 plain language \050avoid abstract metaphors without explanation\051\n Break tasks into small steps\n Reduce cognitive load \050minimal UI clutter\051\n Consistent patterns across screens\n\nEmotional Accessibility\nDoes the product feel safe\054 non\055judgmental\054 and calm\077\n Gentle\054 supportive tone \n No pressure language\n Clear privacy reassurance when uploading personal data\n\n\n)
