9903 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Presentation outline \n\n\nIntro \nThe design challenge\072 \nthis product is aimed for high achievers who are buried under notes and unsure what to do next\nSpark is a thinking space to help them connect the dots and turn the unfinished reflections and notes into small actions \n\nProblem \nUsers have lots of notes and struggle to make sense of them \nThey lack self confidence and belief in themselves to take a next step \n\nPresentation of benefits\n\n\nExamples of evidence)
     /K [ 2485 ]
